WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.085 --> 00:00:03.086
AJAK
For years,

00:00:05.088 --> 00:00:06.339
we have watched...

00:00:08.258 --> 00:00:09.718
WAKANDAN SOLDIERS
Yibambe!

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:11.761
AJAK
...and seen them...

00:00:11.803 --> 00:00:13.054
WAKANDAN SOLDIERS
Yibambe!

00:00:13.096 --> 00:00:16.141
AJAK
...accomplish wonders.

00:00:18.435 --> 00:00:21.312
But we have never interfered...

00:00:22.772 --> 00:00:25.191
Until now.

00:00:26.776 --> 00:00:29.821
ARISHEM
Eternals, the end of one era...

00:00:31.489 --> 00:00:34.284
...is the beginning of another.

00:00:49.132 --> 00:00:50.383
KINGO
Thor used to follow me around

00:00:50.467 --> 00:00:51.676
when he was a little kid.

00:00:52.802 --> 00:00:55.263
Now he's a famous Avenger
and won't return my calls.

00:00:55.305 --> 00:00:56.681
ALL
[Laughter]

